  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Harold sleeps for \\(9\\) hours and works \\(3\\) hours less:\n\n\\[\n9-3=6 \\text{ hours of work}\n\\]\n\nThe work-to-sleep ratio is:\n\n\\[\n6:9\n\\]\n\nSimplifying by \\(3\\):\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2:3}\n\\]",
    "Harold sleeps for \\(10\\) hours and works \\(3\\) hours less:\n\n\\[\n10-3=7 \\text{ hours of work}\n\\]\n\nThus, the work-to-sleep ratio is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{7:10}\n\\]",
